A||N||6||GT-maniac||One touch power windows||||1||
Z||000000||GT-maniac||08-09-2001||10:55 PM||||What I'd like is one touch power windows combined with the power windows on all the time function. Does anyone know someone that supplies this modification in kit form. I know Rodney has the power windows on adapter.||||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroJoe||08-09-2001||11:21 PM||||The full time power window mod isn't very hard to do yourself.  If you look at the pic of rodney's kit, you'll see that it just provides the power window circuit with +12v from the battery, instead of ignition controlled.<P>As for the one touch, Oliver Scholtz has made a kit that he sells.  I believe a kit to do both windows will run about $100 plus shipping.  The full time feature is not a part of this kit.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.franken.de/users/dagobah/luke/fieroidx.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.franken.de/users/dagobah/luke/fieroidx.html</A> <P>I believe that link is correct.||||reg||1
Z||000002||maryjane||08-10-2001||12:50 AM||||Did you see the article in Ogre's cave? I'm doing this now on mine(actually, Jane is). Not as hard as it first appears. Course everything's easy when someone else figures it out first. Thanks Bill & Ogre||||reg||1
